{c: Verse 1}
[C]O maajhi re,        O maajhi [C]re Apana kinaara,
nadiya ki [A#]dhaara [C]hai.        O maajhi [C]re Apana kinaara,
nadiya ki [A#]dhaara [C]hai.        O maajhi [C]re
[C]Saahilon-pe [C]behane-waale,        [C]kabhi suna to [F]hoga ka [C]hin
Ho! [C]Kaagazon ki [C]kashtiyonka,        [C]kahin kinaara [Am]hota na [C]hin.
O maajhi [F]re! Maajhi [C]re,        [C]Koi ki [C]naara, jo [C]kinaare se
[Am]mile woh, [F]apana kinaara [C]hai.        O maajhi [C]re Apana kinaara,
